HAL — CPU-loop memory operations (generic)
===========================================

Software memcpy and memset using plain CPU loops. Works on
any target without DMA hardware. Same interface as mem_dma.

    module oskit.hal

memcpy — copy n bytes from src to dst using a byte loop.
Does not handle overlapping regions.

    memcpy(dst: *byte, src: *byte, n: int)
        var i = 0
        while i < n
            dst[i] = src[i]
            i += 1

memset — fill n bytes at dst with v using a byte loop.

    memset(dst: *byte, v: byte, n: int)
        var i = 0
        while i < n
            dst[i] = v
            i += 1
